sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Service
  participant DB as Service database
  participant R as Outbox relay
  participant K as Kafka
  participant C as Consumer
  participant CDB as Consumer database
  S->>DB: BEGIN, business change + outbox_events row, COMMIT
  loop every second
    R->>DB: read PENDING rows (oldest first)
    R->>K: publish (key = aggregate id)
    R->>DB: mark PUBLISHED, or attempts + 1
  end
  K->>C: deliver (at least once)
  C->>CDB: BEGIN, event id in processed_events?
  alt already processed
    C->>CDB: skip, COMMIT
  else new
    C->>CDB: handle event, insert processed_events, COMMIT
  end
  Note over C,K: After retries fail the event goes to topic.DLT with the reason logged
